--- File: lotteharper-main/feed/templates/feed/photo_email.html ---
```html
<h1>{{ site_name }} - Your Content as Promised</h1>
<p>Dear {{ user.username }},</p>
<p>Thank you for your support! You bought something(s) from {{ site_name }} and everything is attached to this email below.</p>
{% autoescape off %}
{% if photo %}
<img style="width: 60%; max-width: 300px;" src="{{ photo }}" alt="A photo of me from {{ site_name }}"></img>
{% elif photos %}
{% for photo in photos %}
<img style="width: 60%; max-width: 300px;" src="{{ photo }}" alt="A photo of me from {{ site_name }}"></img>
<hr>
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endautoescape %}
{% autoescape off %}
{% if message %}
<p>{{ message }}</p>
{% elif messages %}
{% for message in messages %}
{% if message %}<p>{{ message }}</p>{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endautoescape %}
<p>Use this link to visit the site and see more photos, video, articles, books, and listen to audio as well as call, text or video chat me, I'm usually online :) - <a href="{{ protocol }}://{{ domain }}">click here</a>.</p>
<p>Alternatively, you can paste the following link in your browser's address bar:</p>
<p>{{ protocol }}://{{ domain }}</p>
<p>Thanks for being a part of something awesome. I look forward to seeing you online.</p>
<p>Seeing you there with love,</p>
<p>{{ model_name }}</p>
```


